    core: `Pallas, the principle of pattern recognition and strategic intelligence, and the Sun, conscious identity and purposeful self-expression, are in a 60-degree relationship of easy, productive exchange. The sextile places them in compatible territory where the capacity to think strategically and the drive to express coherent selfhood can support each other without either overwhelming the other. This person can use strategic intelligence when it serves and can also pursue purpose without constantly analyzing how. Pattern recognition is a tool available to the self, not the entirety of what the self is.`,
    behavioral: `The relationship between strategic thinking and identity is balanced. This person can engage their analytical capacity when problems require it and can also set that capacity aside when direct action or emotional presence is what is needed. The sextile allows for intellectual flexibility: the capacity to see patterns when pattern recognition is useful, and to act intuitively when intuition is what serves. The behavioral signature is applied intelligence. The person uses strategic thinking to support their goals rather than as a performance of cleverness.`,
