    core: `Pallas, the principle of pattern recognition and strategic intelligence, stands opposite the Sun, conscious identity and the drive toward autonomous self-expression, across a 180-degree axis of full polarity. At this distance, the capacity to see patterns and the drive to express coherent selfhood face each other across maximum separation. Pallas knows that understanding underlying structures is essential to effective action. The Sun knows that identity requires moving forward with purpose even when all patterns are not yet understood. Neither can be ignored. This is the geometry of a life organized around the negotiation between strategic intelligence and direct expression, between seeing how things work and acting as oneself.`,
